<view class="page"><view class="hero"><view class="logo-text">山羊Goat</view><view class="logo-sub">网球馆</view></view><view class="card"><view class="title">手机号快捷登录</view><view class="desc">用于订场和查看会员卡。头像昵称可稍后在个人中心修改</view><view class="field"><button class="phone-btn" open-type="getPhoneNumber" loading="{{loading}}" data-event-opts="{{[['getphonenumber',[['onGetPhone',['$event']]]]]}}" bindgetphonenumber="__e">手机号快捷登录</button></view><button data-event-opts="{{[['tap',[['skipLogin',['$event']]]]]}}" class="skip-btn" bindtap="__e">暂不登录，返回浏览</button><view class="hint">可先浏览场馆和场地。订场时再登录。点快捷登录会验证手机号。</view></view></view>